# The weather forecast in Russian: ми́нус де́сять
subtitle: "Understand a Russian weather forecast: ми́нус де́сять гра́дусов, моро́з, со́лнце and ве́тер, and a six-line radio forecast to catch by ear."
tags: ["russian","russian weather","weather forecast","градус","russian numbers","russian vocabulary"]
teaches: ["vocabulary/weather","grammar/counting-nouns"]
thumb: "band \"Plus two counts as warm\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"A Russian life: Gagarin","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/97-russian-biography.cast"}

